": ""}, {"path": "/@533793N/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f981a527/uploads/origins/8855f003-5189-4384-803c-bdd7a740f193?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4676ada754b8030c791d73501f9dfad3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f981a527/uploads/origins/8855f003-5189-4384-803c-bdd7a740f193?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4676ada754b8030c791d73501f9dfad3, https://si.imgix.net/f981a527/uploads/origins/8855f003-5189-4384-803c-bdd7a740f193?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a134d6c3329c8464f33a30792352743a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f981a527/uploads/origins/8855f003-5189-4384-803c-bdd7a740f193?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40767a364b1f49c7833130fb56e3c3c8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。絵柄はとても素敵です。\nよければ、私のオリキャラ2人をリクエストさせていただきたいです。\n\n参考はこちらです。キャラクター紹介も含めています。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PFVJLp8wmhDvbB1-nAhfJeZ_MHIdpUZl?usp=sharing\n\n構図やポーズなどはお任せ致します。\n\nご検討宜しくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@533793N/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5fa89763/uploads/origins/fcb10b8f-ecb4-4ba3-a962-99498a200586?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=10588d8d70fa6975b5deeefea78076a8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5fa89763/uploads/origins/fcb10b8f-ecb4-4ba3-a962-99498a200586?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=10588d8d70fa6975b5deeefea78076a8, https://si.imgix.net/5fa89763/uploads/origins/fcb10b8f-ecb4-4ba3-a962-99498a200586?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=midd